# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every checkout, on every platform.
# Git for Windows defaults to CRLF checkouts. That would change the bytes of src/vendor/bip39-english.txt
# (a test pins its SHA-256) and of every file build.rs embeds in the desktop app.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never rewrite bytes of images or archives.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
